# micro-flac is the FLAC backend libchdr's contrib/tangcore-bl616 integration selects for
# MCU targets (-DCHDR_FLAC_BACKEND_MICROFLAC). Fetched, never vendored: it is Apache-2.0
# and libchdr stays BSD-3 for its other consumers. Pinned, because the backend compiles
# against micro-flac's internals.
[submodule "thirdparty/micro-flac"]
	path = thirdparty/micro-flac
	url = https://github.com/esphome-libs/micro-flac.git
